<div><h1>Profil Saya</h1><div class="grid two"><section class="card"><h2>Informasi pribadi</h2><form wire:submit="save"><label>Nama<input wire:model="name"></label><label>Avatar opsional (JPG/PNG, maksimal 2 MB)<input type="file" wire:model="avatarUpload"></label><p>{{ auth()->user()->email }} · Terverifikasi</p><h3>Preferensi email</h3>@foreach(['membership'=>'Keanggotaan','borrowing'=>'Peminjaman','damage'=>'Kerusakan'] as $key=>$label)<label><input type="checkbox" wire:model="{{ $key }}"> {{ $label }}</label>@endforeach<button class="primary">Simpan profil</button></form></section><section class="card"><h2>Ubah kata sandi</h2><form wire:submit="changePassword"><label>Kata sandi lama<input type="password" wire:model="currentPassword"></label><label>Kata sandi baru<input type="password" wire:model="password"></label><label>Konfirmasi<input type="password" wire:model="password_confirmation"></label><button class="primary">Perbarui kata sandi</button></form></section></div><section class="card"><h2>Ubah email</h2><form wire:submit="emailChange"><label>Email baru<input type="email" wire:model="email"></label><button class="secondary">Kirim verifikasi email baru</button></form></section><section class="card"><h2>Hapus akun</h2><p>Histori dipertahankan. Ditolak jika Anda Admin terakhir atau memiliki kewajiban terbuka.</p><form wire:submit="deleteAccount" wire:confirm="Hapus akun Anda?"><label>Kata sandi<input type="password" wire:model="deletePassword"></label><button class="secondary">Hapus akun</button></form></section></div>
